# FreeLLMAPI Universal Free-Tier Token Pool

- **Local Gateway**: Connect Cursor to `http://127.0.0.1:3001/v1` with OpenAI compatibility.
- **Capacity**: 34+ providers, ~7.4B tokens/mo free pooled capacity.
- **Failover**: When running long batch tasks, use combos (`freellm-coding`, `freellm-fast`) to ensure automatic 429 failover.
- **Status Check**: `python3 scripts/freellm_cli.py status`.
